    "resolved_findings": [
      "Slide 4: the ACRP 175 leader line struck through the second line of its own annotation and did not reach the 0.45 marker; replaced with a legend-keyed note (blue dot matching the on-ruler marker) placed in the clear field right of the default-zone callout, and the subtitle text frame was deepened to remove a text-overflow warning.",
      "Slide 11: the dashed projection connector was mis-rotated — it struck the '1.63x (2024, reported)' label and the 'Projected range' note and ended short of the projected point; recomputed as a true dot-to-dot chord between the 1.63x and ~1.3x markers. The '~$5.5B of new debt phases in, 2025-2028' callout covered the '~1.3x (projected over five years)' label; callout relocated to the empty lower-left field and the note moved above the connector.",
